🔹 Fortify SSC Upgrade Runbook (23.2.1 → 25.2.1)
1. Pre-Upgrade Checklist

✅ Download Fortify SSC 25.2.1 WAR file and documentation.

✅ Verify Java and Tomcat versions meet 25.2.1 requirements.

✅ Confirm DB engine (MySQL, PostgreSQL, or MSSQL) is supported in 25.2.1.

✅ Backup:

Database (full dump/backup).

FortifyConfig.properties.

Certificates (keystore.jks or PEM files).

ssc-content folder if present.

✅ Verify license file works for 25.2.1.

✅ Notify stakeholders: SSC downtime required (1–2 hrs).

2. Upgrade Steps (Linux – Tomcat)
Stop Services
# Stop Tomcat
sudo systemctl stop tomcat

# Confirm process is stopped
ps -ef | grep tomcat

Backup Database

PostgreSQL Example:

pg_dump -U fortify -h localhost -Fc fortifydb > /backup/fortifydb_23.2.1.dump


MySQL/MariaDB Example:

mysqldump -u fortify -p fortifydb > /backup/fortifydb_23.2.1.sql

Backup Config
cp /opt/tomcat/webapps/ssc/WEB-INF/classes/FortifyConfig.properties /backup/
cp -r /opt/tomcat/.keystore /backup/

Replace WAR
rm -rf /opt/tomcat/webapps/ssc
rm -f /opt/tomcat/webapps/ssc.war

cp /installers/ssc-25.2.1.war /opt/tomcat/webapps/ssc.war

Start Tomcat
sudo systemctl start tomcat
tail -f /opt/tomcat/logs/catalina.out

3. Upgrade Steps (Windows – Tomcat)
Stop Services
net stop Tomcat9

Backup Database

MSSQL Example:

BACKUP DATABASE fortifydb TO DISK='D:\backup\fortifydb_23.2.1.bak';

Backup Config
copy "C:\Tomcat\webapps\ssc\WEB-INF\classes\FortifyConfig.properties" D:\backup\
copy "C:\Tomcat\.keystore" D:\backup\

Replace WAR
rmdir /S /Q "C:\Tomcat\webapps\ssc"
del "C:\Tomcat\webapps\ssc.war"

copy "D:\installers\ssc-25.2.1.war" "C:\Tomcat\webapps\ssc.war"

Start Tomcat
net start Tomcat9

4. Schema Upgrade

Log in as SSC admin in the browser after restart.

You’ll be prompted for a database schema upgrade.

Confirm → let SSC perform schema migration.

Monitor Tomcat logs for Schema update completed successfully.

5. Post-Upgrade Validation

Log in → check version = 25.2.1.

Validate:

Applications, users, roles intact.

Upload a new FPR (Fortify SCA result).

Integrations (Keycloak/LDAP, pipelines).

Run a sample report (CSV/PDF) to confirm functionality.

6. Rollback Plan

If upgrade fails:

Stop Tomcat.

Drop the upgraded DB and restore backup:

Postgres:

pg_restore -U fortify -h localhost -d fortifydb /backup/fortifydb_23.2.1.dump


MySQL:

mysql -u fortify -p fortifydb < /backup/fortifydb_23.2.1.sql


MSSQL:

RESTORE DATABASE fortifydb FROM DISK='D:\backup\fortifydb_23.2.1.bak' WITH REPLACE;


Replace WAR back to 23.2.1:

cp /backup/ssc-23.2.1.war /opt/tomcat/webapps/ssc.war


Start Tomcat.
